WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:06.960
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today I am going&nbsp;
to explain a Chinese action film called&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:19.680
“Kung Fu Chefs”. Watch out and take care!
Wong Ping Yee works as a chef in a village in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:26.240
China. He is also the bearer of the Dragon Head&nbsp;
Cleaver, a symbol of power to his clan. Everyone&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:32.960
from the clan knows and respects him, much to his&nbsp;
nephew Wong Kai Joe’s annoyance. Kai Joe believes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:32.960 --> 00:00:38.400
that he should be the rightful owner of the sacred&nbsp;
cleaver since his father was the last owner. One&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:44.480
day, Ping Yee and his clan are hired to work for a&nbsp;
huge gathering organised for the higher officials&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.480 --> 00:00:50.000
of the village. Ping Yee’s disciple accidentally&nbsp;
burns the pork, which was supposed to be the main&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:56.080
dish. He scolds the guy and takes it upon himself&nbsp;
to slaughter and cook the pig in less than thirty&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:56.080 --> 00:01:01.360
minutes. Using the sacred cleaver, he cuts&nbsp;
the pig with precision in only a few seconds.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:01.360 --> 00:01:06.800
Half an hour later, the dish is ready and to&nbsp;
be served. Ping Yee adds some salt to the dish&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:13.120
as a finishing touch, unknown that his disciple&nbsp;
has mixed a drug in it under Kai Joe’s order.
&nbsp;

00:01:13.120 --> 00:01:18.800
The dish is arranged beautifully and served to&nbsp;
the guests. Soon, they start to fall down because&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:18.800 --> 00:01:24.800
of the drug and the blame falls upon Ping Yee’s&nbsp;
cooking. He realizes what his disciple has done&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:24.800 --> 00:01:30.720
and asks him for the reason. The guy pushes him&nbsp;
aside and runs away, scared of being caught. Ping&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:30.720 --> 00:01:35.840
Yee runs behind him but is stopped by a group&nbsp;
of men who accuse him of trying to poison them.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:35.840 --> 00:01:40.080
Besides being a cook, Ping Yee is&nbsp;
also an excellent martial artist.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:40.080 --> 00:01:45.440
He single-handedly takes on the group of men&nbsp;
and defeats them all. At last, he finally&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:45.440 --> 00:01:50.480
catches his disciple and is about to hit him&nbsp;
with a cleaver when his associate stops him.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:50.480 --> 00:01:56.000
He belittles Ping Yee for trying to blame others&nbsp;
for his mistake. Before Ping Yee can explain&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:56.000 --> 00:02:02.080
himself, he is kicked out of the village, deemed&nbsp;
unworthy to be the owner of the dragon cleaver.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:02.080 --> 00:02:07.040
Somewhere else, in the school of martial arts&nbsp;
and cooking, a teacher organizes a competition&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:07.040 --> 00:02:11.760
between his students. He announces that the&nbsp;
one who can put the school’s emblem back to its&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:11.760 --> 00:02:17.280
original place will receive a special gift. 
The students go crazy to get the emblem and start&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:17.280 --> 00:02:23.280
fighting each other. One of them named Lung Kin Yat climbs&nbsp;
on top of the tables, kicks the others away,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:23.280 --> 00:02:28.640
and acquires it. But the others attack him before&nbsp;
he can put the emblem back. Amidst the chaos,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:28.640 --> 00:02:33.840
the emblem lands on the teacher’s hand and the&nbsp;
students attack him as well. During a chase,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:33.840 --> 00:02:38.800
Kin Yat gets his hands on the emblem and puts&nbsp;
it back on the platform without anyone seeing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:38.800 --> 00:02:44.160
him. During the lunch break, the teacher comes&nbsp;
to the cafeteria looking for Kin Yat. He plays&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:44.160 --> 00:02:48.560
a prank on the teacher and gets into a&nbsp;
friendly fight with him. Kin Yat proves&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:48.560 --> 00:02:54.080
his talent by fighting using just a roll of dough&nbsp;
and turning it into noodles at the same time. 
&nbsp;

00:02:54.080 --> 00:02:59.520
The teacher advises him to meet a cook named&nbsp;
Shum Fong Kwan. He believes that Kin Yat has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:59.520 --> 00:03:05.120
learned everything he can from the school but&nbsp;
he is yet to learn about the deep idea of food.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:05.120 --> 00:03:11.920
Later, Kin Yat leaves, looking for the master chef&nbsp;
Shum Fong Kwan to start his training. The master&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:11.920 --> 00:03:17.520
chef works in a restaurant named Four Seas. The&nbsp;
owner of the restaurant, Shum Ching, is looking&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:17.520 --> 00:03:22.640
for several different recipes to improve the&nbsp;
ratings. Her sister Shum Ying helps her with the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:22.640 --> 00:03:27.600
process but the sisters are distressed because&nbsp;
the dishes are not up to their standard.
&nbsp;

00:03:27.600 --> 00:03:34.080
Kin Yat arrives looking for Shum and is asked to&nbsp;
wait. At the same time, Ping Yee also arrives at&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:34.080 --> 00:03:40.240
the hotel to enjoy traditional Cantonese food.&nbsp;
Ching offers Ping Yee some tea and is surprised&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:40.240 --> 00:03:45.760
when he can tell apart their secret ingredient&nbsp;
from only a sip. To test the hotel’s chef,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:45.760 --> 00:03:51.920
Shum, Ping Yee orders traditional Chinese food&nbsp;
called the water cabbage. The chef brings the dish&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:51.920 --> 00:03:55.520
and asks for Ping Yee’s opinion on&nbsp;
it. When he calls the food bland,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:55.520 --> 00:04:00.400
Shum gets offended and challenges Ping Yee to&nbsp;
a cookout. Since they will need an assistant,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:00.400 --> 00:04:06.560
Kin Yat offers to help Ping Yee. Ching wants to&nbsp;
create innovative dishes for her restaurant so she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:06.560 --> 00:04:12.560
doesn’t object. After some time, both the chefs&nbsp;
present their dishes. Shum’s signature chicken&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:12.560 --> 00:04:18.960
is delicious but on tasting Ping Yee’s traditional&nbsp;
chicken, the sisters are amazed. A flashback shows&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:18.960 --> 00:04:23.760
us that he coated the chicken with sugar syrup&nbsp;
to make it remain boiling from the inside. 
&nbsp;

00:04:23.760 --> 00:04:29.680
As described in the traditional recipe books, he&nbsp;
didn’t use a knife to cut the pieces. Shum accepts&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:29.680 --> 00:04:35.680
his defeat and resigns from his position as a cook&nbsp;
in the restaurant. In his place, Ching appoints&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:35.680 --> 00:04:42.080
both Ping Yee and Kin Yat as the head chef and&nbsp;
the helper. That night, she finds out that Ping&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:42.080 --> 00:04:46.960
Yee’s brother, who taught him everything about&nbsp;
cooking, is also her father’s student. She is more&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:46.960 --> 00:04:52.640
than happy to have someone like Ping Yee as their&nbsp;
head chef because his cooking style and principles&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:52.640 --> 00:04:59.200
are identical to her father’s. To see if Ping&nbsp;
Yee is really as talented as he seems, Kin Yat&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:59.200 --> 00:05:04.880
challenges him to a fish cutting competition.&nbsp;
Kin Yat chooses a globe fish for his dish.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:04.880 --> 00:05:10.720
It needs very skilled cutting abilities to chop&nbsp;
the fish without losing its original taste.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:10.720 --> 00:05:16.640
Kin Yat impresses Ping Yee with his skills with&nbsp;
this one. When it's Ping Yee’s turn, he uses a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:16.640 --> 00:05:22.800
normal prime fish for the dish. He slices off&nbsp;
parts of its flesh and leaves the fish alive&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:22.800 --> 00:05:28.960
even after making a dish out of it. Both Ching&nbsp;
and Kin Yat are shocked to see that the fish&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:28.960 --> 00:05:35.200
can still swim. They register that no one can&nbsp;
compete against Ping Yee’s cutting skills. The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:35.200 --> 00:05:41.040
next day at work, Kin Yat is ready to learn things&nbsp;
from his new master. To his disappointment, Ping&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:41.040 --> 00:05:46.640
Yee gives him the task to sharpen the knives. 
He stays up the entire night to complete the task&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:46.640 --> 00:05:52.000
and gets it done by the morning. But when he shows&nbsp;
it to Ping Yee, the cook is still not impressed.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:57.040
He says that before teaching him how to cook, he&nbsp;
will have to learn to cut meat and vegetables.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:57.040 --> 00:06:02.720
Since slicing, mincing, and grinding technique are
the basics to be a great cook, Kin Yat is given&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:02.720 --> 00:06:08.560
the responsibility to cut all the vegetables that&nbsp;
are used in the restaurant. Ping Yee’s nephew Kai&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:08.560 --> 00:06:13.920
Joe who was responsible for him getting kicked out&nbsp;
of the village, also owns a restaurant in the city&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:13.920 --> 00:06:19.200
that is a rival to the four seas restaurant. He&nbsp;
hates his uncle for being the reason his father&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:19.200 --> 00:06:25.280
left the village a long time ago. Chef Shum&nbsp;
meets Kai Joe asking to be hired as a chef&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:25.280 --> 00:06:30.640
in his restaurant now that he resigned from his&nbsp;
old job. But Kai Joe says they already work with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:30.640 --> 00:06:36.080
a master chef and do not need his services. 
When he finds out that the uncle he hates works&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:36.080 --> 00:06:41.600
for his rival restaurant, he is agitated. Kai&nbsp;
Joe’s right-hand man, Leung who was a village&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:41.600 --> 00:06:47.040
member a long time ago, suggests he forget about&nbsp;
the rivalry since he cannot go against his uncle.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:47.040 --> 00:06:52.473
This angers him even more and he almost beats&nbsp;
Leung to death. A flashback shows us that Kai&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:52.473 --> 00:06:59.040
Joe’s father Wong Ping Kei was a great cook,&nbsp;
but with time, he turned into an alcoholic.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:59.040 --> 00:07:03.920
Ping Yee was against his brother being the&nbsp;
bearer of the dragon cleaver because of it.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:03.920 --> 00:07:09.680
One night they got into a fight which ended when&nbsp;
Kei hurt his hand, making him unable to cook. 
&nbsp;

00:07:09.680 --> 00:07:15.440
After leaving Ping Yee in charge of his son, he&nbsp;
left the village but Kai Joe still blames Ping Yee&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:15.440 --> 00:07:21.040
for his father’s disappearance and wants revenge.&nbsp;
Back in the present, Kin Yat continues to cut the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:21.040 --> 00:07:26.080
vegetables for two weeks straight. During this&nbsp;
time, he playfully bickers with Ying and starts&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:26.080 --> 00:07:31.760
liking her. Ping Yee teaches his techniques to&nbsp;
all the restaurant employees, including Ying&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:31.760 --> 00:07:37.920
and Kin Yat. Their ratings soon go up because of&nbsp;
his innovative dishes. One night, Kai Joe and his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:37.920 --> 00:07:42.800
associates come to the restaurant for a meal.&nbsp;
They put nails on the dish and blame the cook&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:42.800 --> 00:07:49.600
for putting their lives in danger. Because of&nbsp;
this, all their customers leave the premises,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:49.600 --> 00:07:55.760
refusing to eat the food. Kai Joe insults Ping&nbsp;
Yee but the man remains calm and apologizes.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:55.760 --> 00:08:00.240
He doesn’t want to fight with his family and&nbsp;
understands why his nephew would hate him. 
&nbsp;

00:08:00.240 --> 00:08:05.600
In the following scene, Kin Yat and Ying are at a&nbsp;
store shopping for groceries. They are distressed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:05.600 --> 00:08:10.800
because, after the nail fiasco, they have lost&nbsp;
half of their customers. Ying notices Kai joe&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:10.800 --> 00:08:15.280
is also shopping for groceries near them.&nbsp;
Still mad at him for ruining their business,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:15.280 --> 00:08:21.280
she attacks the guy. Kai Joe’s henchmen soon join&nbsp;
and fight against the two. Kin Yat easily beats&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:21.280 --> 00:08:27.200
them up in no time while Ying struggles against&nbsp;
Kai Joe. At one point, they are surrounded by&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:27.200 --> 00:08:31.840
the rival group but manage to trick them and&nbsp;
run away. While trying to catch their breaths,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:31.840 --> 00:08:36.720
they see an advertisement for the Chef of the year&nbsp;
competition. If their chef wins the competition,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:36.720 --> 00:08:41.920
their ratings will go up again. However, when&nbsp;
they ask Ping Yee to be in the competition,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:41.920 --> 00:08:47.120
he refuses. It turns out he had gotten a call from&nbsp;
his village that morning. They are asking him to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:47.120 --> 00:08:52.480
return because, after his departure, nothing&nbsp;
has been the same. Ping Yee is confident in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:52.480 --> 00:08:58.240
his teachings and asks his Kin Yat to represent&nbsp;
their restaurant in the competition. The next day,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:58.240 --> 00:09:02.960
Kin Yat and his assistant get ready for the first&nbsp;
round of the competition. They are going against&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:02.960 --> 00:09:08.560
six other chefs but their biggest opponents&nbsp;
are Shum and his partner chef Chow-to. 
&nbsp;

00:09:08.560 --> 00:09:13.280
The competition starts and the chefs make their&nbsp;
signature dishes. For the first few minutes,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:13.280 --> 00:09:18.800
Kin Yat contemplates what would be the best dish&nbsp;
to make. Ching, from the audience, suggests he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:18.800 --> 00:09:24.320
make a horse platter that is made of pigeon,&nbsp;
duck, and chicken. The dish is complicated to make&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:24.320 --> 00:09:30.400
because it can overcook pretty easily but if made&nbsp;
correctly, it is delicious. Kin Yat starts&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:30.400 --> 00:09:36.000
working on his dish. In the meantime, Chow To&nbsp;
skins an ox’s head to cook a famous shecuan&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:36.000 --> 00:09:42.160
dish. An hour later, all the dishes are presented&nbsp;
in front of the judges. They critique all of them&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:42.160 --> 00:09:47.840
but when it comes to Kin Yat’s horse platter, they&nbsp;
only have nice things to say. They also seem to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:47.840 --> 00:09:53.760
enjoy Chow To’s dish thoroughly. The results are&nbsp;
announced and both Chow To and Kin Yat pass the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:53.760 --> 00:09:59.200
first round. Now, for the final round they will&nbsp;
have to go against each other, one on one. Kin Yat&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:59.200 --> 00:10:04.160
and the team celebrate their first win and start&nbsp;
preparing for the finals. When Kai Joe finds out&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:04.160 --> 00:10:10.080
about this, he sends some thugs to beat up Kin Yat&nbsp;
so he wouldn’t be present in the next competition.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:10.080 --> 00:10:15.760
Kin Yat fights them to his best but is locked up&nbsp;
in a refrigerator with Ying. The following day,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:15.760 --> 00:10:20.240
he somehow manages to escape with Ying’s&nbsp;
help and is back in the competition. 
&nbsp;

00:10:20.800 --> 00:10:26.560
In the village, Kai Joe goes to meet his uncle and&nbsp;
kill him once and for all. Ping Yee is attacked&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:26.560 --> 00:10:31.600
by a group of thugs who he fights bravely.&nbsp;
Even after getting beaten up pretty badly,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:31.600 --> 00:10:38.080
he manages to send them away and teach his nephew&nbsp;
a lesson. He has a chance to kill Kai Joe but he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:38.080 --> 00:10:43.520
doesn't because he still thinks of him as family.&nbsp;
In the meantime, the cooking competition starts.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:43.520 --> 00:10:49.680
This time, the chefs are told to make a simplistic&nbsp;
soup dish but without any seasoning. This means&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:49.680 --> 00:10:54.720
they will have to make it flavourful using only&nbsp;
the main ingredients. Chow To quickly starts to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:54.720 --> 00:11:00.000
cook a traditional chicken soup while Kin Yat&nbsp;
thinks about Ping Yee’s teachings. He remembers&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:04.400
the cabbage and water dish that Ping Yee had&nbsp;
ordered when he first came to the restaurant.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:04.400 --> 00:11:08.960
It has only three ingredients with no seasoning&nbsp;
and if cooked with the right technique,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:08.960 --> 00:11:13.920
the simple dish will blow people’s minds. He&nbsp;
starts to cook it right how Ping Yee had taught&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:13.920 --> 00:11:19.280
him. He uses minced chicken mixed with water&nbsp;
for the soup. Following that, he pokes holes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:19.280 --> 00:11:24.400
in cabbages to run the soup through them and&nbsp;
make it flavourful. Chow To, on the other hand,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:24.400 --> 00:11:29.920
uses a traditional oven to cook his chicken soup&nbsp;
thoroughly. However, he uses more ingredients than&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:29.920 --> 00:11:35.920
Kin Yat and goes slightly against the rules. 
Ping Yee arrives there and compliments Kin Yat for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:35.920 --> 00:11:41.680
doing his best. At last, the judges are served&nbsp;
with two equally appetizing dishes. At first,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:41.680 --> 00:11:46.960
they try Chow To’s soup and are mind blown by&nbsp;
the flavors. But when they try Kin Yat’s dish,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:46.960 --> 00:11:53.520
they simply close their eyes and stay frozen,&nbsp;
enjoying its simplicity. Chow To goes to one&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:53.520 --> 00:11:58.800
of the judges and tries his leftovers. When&nbsp;
he gets a taste, he simply takes his hat off,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:58.800 --> 00:12:04.560
accepting defeat. Kin Yat and the team celebrate&nbsp;
the win. Ping Yee even hands him the dragon head&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:04.560 --> 00:12:10.960
cleaver as a gift. To everyone’s surprise, Ping&nbsp;
Yee’s elder brother who had disappeared years ago&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:10.960 --> 00:12:16.960
arrives at the set. He reconciles with Ping Yee&nbsp;
and even tries the cabbage water dish. A few weeks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:16.960 --> 00:12:22.080
later, all of them are at the restaurant. Kin&nbsp;
Yat has decided to go on a tour with Ping Yee&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:22.080 --> 00:12:26.960
to learn about all the different cuisines in&nbsp;
the world. In the last scene, he promises his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:26.960 --> 00:12:31.440
girlfriend Ying to return soon. 
